OL,3,GNEWSAJames Morrison and The Fratellis
OL,4,Acancel Kelpies Live shows
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinger-songwriter James Morrison and
OL,7,FScottish rock band The Fratellis have
OL,8,Fcancelled their Kelpies Live shows this
OL,9,Fweekend after a dispute with the event
OL,10,Fpromoters.
OL,12,FThe Glasgow trio said earlier this week
OL,13,Fthat their show at Helix Park, Falkirk
OL,14,Fon Friday would not take place.
OL,16,FThe band said the event promoters "have
OL,17,Fbeen unable to fulfill their
OL,18,Fcommitments to the band to perform."
OL,20,FJames Morrison's show on Sunday has
OL,21,Falso been cancelled according to
OL,22,Fpromoters XFire's website.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
